    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "WHAT THIS DOES\n\nReads every trip from the sheet daily.\n\n3 days before departure → sends a WhatsApp reminder\nwith a pre-trip checklist.\n\n1 day after return → sends a WhatsApp welcome-back\nmessage asking how the trip went.\n\nThe Status column stops duplicate messages. A trip\nonly gets one message per stage, ever. Everything\nelse gets skipped that day.\n\nAfter each message sends, the CEO gets a Telegram\nnotification and the sheet updates with the new status.\n\nBuilt for: a travel agency that keeps trips in a\nspreadsheet and kept forgetting to follow up with\ncustomers.",
        "height": 528,
        "width": 448,
        "color": 5
      },
